This project depends on and dynamically fetches Google's A2UI framework
(https://github.com/google/A2UI) into `third_party/A2UI/` via `scripts/ensure_a2ui.sh`.
A2UI is licensed separately under the Apache License, Version 2.0; see
`third_party/A2UI/LICENSE` for its full text. That license applies only to
the A2UI framework code itself, not to the original A2Learn code in this
repository (`agent/`, `apps/`, `packages/a2learn-catalog/`, `packages/embed/`,
`packages/viewer-kit/`), which is covered by the MIT License above.
